gyH(){return"That's the rest, not the part the question asks for: read it again."},
gyr(){return"Undo each step with the opposite operation: + with \u2212, \xd7 with \xf7."},
gyg(){return"That's only the first step: the question has another one."},
gy5(){return"That's the area: the perimeter adds up all the sides."},
gyA(){return"That's one away in the last digit: check that last column again."},
gyC(){return"One column is off by one: check each column again, especially the one before the last."},
gyk(){return"A fraction got turned upside down: to multiply, keep it the right way up and multiply straight across."},
gym(){return"The bottom numbers already match: keep the bottom number and work only with the tops."},
